					"rate_of_fire": "6",
					"shots": "20(30)",
					"usage": "Standard",
					"usage_notes": "ST-independent, fused to the arm. Shots regrow from the bearer's own spine-glands; treat \"reload\" as a half-minute of not firing rather than a magazine change.",
