					"usage_notes": "Area Effect, 4-yard radius (B102): as the Barbed Strangler's own burst above, at a much larger radius and heavier throw weight. Everyone else in the radius takes the secondary line's damage. ST-independent; grown only on Tyrannofex-scale bioforms. Shots regrow over the listed time.",
