		{
			"id": "tlhsytd0UhxZRJ5xe",
			"name": "Lash Whip",
			"reference": "B41",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A long, muscular, whip-like limb almost always carried alongside a Bonesword: not primarily a killing weapon, but a control one, lashing out to entangle and unbalance a target so the blade in the creature's other limb can land a clean, undefended blow. Codex: Tyranids background is explicit that Lash Whip and Bonesword are a matched pair on Tyranid Warriors and Primes, one pinning while the other kills.\n\nDesign: No framework anchor gives this weapon exact numbers, only its control-weapon role, so it is built directly on that role: Binding (B41, 2 points/level) at level 20, matching a Tyranid Warrior/Prime's own ST 24 (the figure this entry was priced at, before the strength ladder raised the Warrior to ST 34; Binding is a fixed trait and is not rescaled, and a whip grips less than a solid limb) = 40 points, plus a minor Crushing Striker (B88, 5 points) with the Long 1 enhancement for its extra reach (this project's own estimated +40%/level, since Basic Set's core rules don't tabulate a Claws/Striker reach extension and this project's Necron/Ork files already document similar own-estimate percentages for un-tabled Basic Set options): 5x1.4=7. Total 40+7=47. No exact- dice penetration check applies to a Binding-based control weapon in the way it does to a damage-dealing one; its function is to set up the Bonesword's own (10)-divisor hit, not to punch through armour itself. Reach 1-2 and Parry -1 reflect a long, flexible limb that reaches further than a talon but is a worse parrying tool for it.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Tyranids"
			],
			"base_points": 47,
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "wwWVW7WB5cYa-2iUM",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "cr"
					},
					"reach": "1,2",
					"parry": "-1",
					"usage": "Standard (entangle)",
					"usage_notes": "Binding 20 (B41): a successful hit entangles rather than damages by default; the target must beat the Lash Whip's own Binding 20 (as an effective ST/DX contest per B41) to break free before its bearer's Bonesword or Scything Talons finish the job. The listed cr damage is what a Lash Whip does if its bearer chooses to lash rather than bind on a given hit.",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "dx",
							"modifier": 0
						},
						{
							"type": "skill",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Brawling"
							}
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "t8I4ndQjg_dgeUeQQ",
			"name": "Monstrous Scything Talons",
			"reference": "B88",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Scything talons grown to Carnifex or Hive Tyrant scale: blades the size of a man, capable of shearing clean through a light vehicle's hull as easily as a Marine's plate. Codex: Tyranids background treats monstrous scything talons as one of the Carnifex's signature close-combat options, a genuine threat to armour that would shrug off a Warrior's own scything talons entirely.\n\nDesign: Framework.md's own anchor: \"Monstrous scything talons | sw+4d(3) cut.\" Built at a Carnifex's own ST 60 (sw 9d): Cutting Striker (B88, 7 points) with Armor Divisor (3) (+100%) = 14 for the sw+0(3) baseline; the anchor's own +4d is bought as Innate Attack (Cut) (B61, 7/die) at 4 dice = 28, with Armor Divisor (3) (+100%) and Melee Attack, Reach C (-30%): net +70%, 28x1.7=47.6, rounded to 48. Total 14+48=62. Checked by exact dice distribution at ST 60 (sw+4d(3) = 13d(3)): averages 45.5 and penetrates Astartes plate (DR 100, eff. 33.3) 97.5% of the time, Gravis (DR 130) 62.6%, and a Terminator (DR 200, eff. 66.7) 0%. A Hive Tyrant at ST 55 (12d+1(3), average 43) gets 94.6% against Astartes plate, 46.7% against Gravis and 0% against a Terminator. Against vehicles at ST 60: AV10 97.5%, AV11 21.0%, AV12 and up 0%. That is a decisive Marine-killer and a light-vehicle cracker, but not a Terminator-killer: the crushing claws below are the swarm's armour-buster.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Tyranids"
			],
			"base_points": 62,
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "wgYPgrXgFVJpSyh3f",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
